# Raw OCR — dead rules removed 2026-08-18. They named pre-recategorisation paths
# (Hora/UttaraKalamrita/...) that moved in 1cccca6, so they had matched nothing for weeks.
# Replaced by the repo-wide rule at the bottom: sources live in ../sanskrit-texts-sources/.

